[recv] {"method":"item/completed","params":{"item":{"type":"agentMessage","id":"msg_0b0f8c9d9337e6cc016a21aede33a8819892dc8cc87e7e526e","text":"Implemented the RP2040 tscircuit schematic test in [index.circuit.tsx](/workspace/index.circuit.tsx:1).\n\nCreated:\n- JLCPCB-imported RP2040 component at [imports/RP2040.tsx](/workspace/imports/RP2040.tsx:1), imported via `tsci import --jlcpcb RP2040`\n- `routingDisabled` board with USB-C, 3.3V regulator, RP2040 core power, crystal, QSPI flash, BOOTSEL, reset, SWD, LEDs, and GPIO headers\n- Generated outputs:\n  - [dist/index/circuit.json](/workspace/dist/index/circuit.json)\n  - [__snapshots__/index.circuit-schematic.snap.svg](/workspace/__snapshots__/index.circuit-schematic.snap.svg)\n  - [__snapshots__/index.circuit-pcb.snap.svg](/workspace/__snapshots__/index.circuit-pcb.snap.svg)\n\nVerification run:\n- `npx tsc --noEmit` passed\n- `tsci check schematic-placement` passed with no placement issues\n- `tsci build index.circuit.tsx` produced circuit JSON, with expected schematic-test noise around missing PCB traces because `routingDisabled` is set\n- `tsci snapshot index.circuit.tsx` succeeded\n\n**TSCircuit Developer Feedback**\n- Confusing/surprising: `connections` are enough for schematic connectivity but still produce “missing trace” build warnings, which is noisy for a deliberate schematic-only `routingDisabled` run.\n- Wasted most time: distinguishing actionable build errors from DRC-style warnings, especially inferred supplier footprint mismatch warnings on generic passives.\n- Helpful changes: clearer docs for schematic-only test patterns, including whether `connections` should be preferred over `<trace />` and how to suppress PCB trace DRC when `routingDisabled` is intentional.\n- Friction points: `tsci import --jlcpcb` worked well, but the expected package/API name was not obvious; `crystal2_pin_3225` looked plausible but failed while only `hc49` was documented locally.","phase":"final_answer","memoryCitation":null},"threadId":"019e938c-1989-7941-9e27-ff620c79c5db","turnId":"019e938c-19ca-78f3-89fe-12a91cdbd529","completedAtMs":1780592358431}}
